{"id":531,"title":"挑战9: 数组逆序计数","summary":"在本课中，我们将解决计算一个数组逆序计数的难题。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5f6b77da-3e1a-4afe-aa25-eb05956f33aa","text":"## 什么是逆序计数？\n\n> **逆序计数表示一个列表离排序有多远或多近。**如果一个列表已排序了(从小到大)，逆序数是**0**。但如果以相反的顺序排序的，逆序数将是**最大值**。\n\n考虑`i`和`j`，使得`i < j`且`lst[i]> lst[j]`，那么在列表中存在一个逆序。\n\n**例如** : \n\n```text\n [9, 5, 6, 11, 8, 10] \n\n 逆序数 = 5 \n\n i-e: [9, 5], [9, 6], [9, 8], [11, 8], [11, 10]\n\n```\n\n请看下图，以更好地理解：","text_html":"<h2>什么是逆序计数？</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>逆序计数表示一个列表离排序有多远或多近。<strong>如果一个列表已排序了(从小到大)，逆序数是</strong>0</strong>。但如果以相反的顺序排序的，逆序数将是<strong>最大值</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>考虑<code>i</code>和<code>j</code>，使得<code>i &lt; j</code>且<code>lst[i]&gt; lst[j]</code>，那么在列表中存在一个逆序。</p>\n<p><strong>例如</strong> :</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\"> [9, 5, 6, 11, 8, 10] \n\n 逆序数 = 5 \n\n i-e: [9, 5], [9, 6], [9, 8], [11, 8], [11, 10]\n\n</code></pre>\n<p>请看下图，以更好地理解：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"CanvasAnimation","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6e8314f1-e011-4aae-8cb4-5383047eb640","width":600,"height":380,"canvas_objects":[{"caption":"显示如何计算一个给定列表的逆序数","width":600,"height":380,"canvas_json":"{\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"objects\":[{\"type\":\"group\",\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"originX\":\"left\",\"originY\":\"top\",\"left\":108,\"top\":195,\"width\":89.33,\"height\":50.67,\"fill\":\"\",\"stroke\":null,\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeDashArray\":null,\"strokeLineCap\":\"butt\",\"strokeDashOffset\":0,\"strokeLineJoin\":\"miter\",\"strokeMiterLimit\":10,\"scaleX\":1,\"scaleY\":1,\"angle\":0,\"flipX\":false,\"flipY\":false,\"opacity\":1,\"shadow\":null,\"visible\":true,\"clipTo\":null,\"backgroundColor\":\"\",\"fillRule\":\"nonzero\",\"paintFirst\":\"fill\",\"globalCompositeOperation\":\"source-over\",\"transformMatrix\":null,\"skewX\":0,\"skewY\":0,\"objects\":[{\"type\":\"polygon\",\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"originX\":\"left\",\"originY\":\"top\",\"left\":-3